OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of dragging teacher to
OL,4,Ahis death in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a head teacher who was
OL,8,Fdragged to his death for more than a
OL,9,Fmile while trapped under the wheels of
OL,10,Fa car.
OL,12,FSimon Richardson crashed into
OL,13,F56-year-old Michael Mullins, who was
OL,14,Fcycling home from work on the evening
OL,15,Fof 20 April in the village of Warburton
OL,16,Fin Greater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
