OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of dragging teacher to
OL,4,Ahis death in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors claimed Richardson, 35,
OL,7,Ffled the scene of the crash before
OL,8,Fstopping to try to dislodge the injured
OL,9,Fbut still-living cyclist and then
OL,10,Fdriving on with Mr Mullins still lodged
OL,11,Funderneath the vehicle.
OL,13,FRichardson was also found guilty of
OL,14,Fdangerous driving and will be sentenced
OL,15,Fon Monday.
